Package: power-theme
Architecture: amd64
Depends: cosmoe, cosmoe-desktop, cosmoe-dev, attr, g++, binutils, hicolor-icon-theme,
 ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: theme manager for Hokku apps and the Hokku session
 Power Theme switches window borders, controls, colours, fonts and icons
 between themes, for Hokku's applications and, through labwc-hokku, every
 window in the Hokku session. Its window decorators and control looks come
 built for the packaged Hokku; "Build add-ons…" builds them again for the
 user (with the compiler and Hokku's development files it depends on).
